WEBVTT

00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:04.610
The three separated at a fork in the road.

00:00:05.160 --> 00:00:08.150
And now their whereabouts are undisclosed. Do they want to protect themselves? Other people?

00:00:08.150 --> 00:00:09.830
Or heavenly dreams?

00:00:10.460 --> 00:00:12.750
The creases of disorder are a cauldron of three.

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:15.370
To an endless, eternal picture of Hell,

00:00:16.250 --> 00:00:19.500
pushing through time a door is dispelled.

00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:24.810
Your grudge shall be released.

00:00:34.260 --> 00:00:35.690
Mikage Yuzuki.

00:00:36.270 --> 00:00:39.490
You will someday become Jigoku Shoujo.

00:00:40.870 --> 00:00:42.040
I wonder.

00:00:44.390 --> 00:00:47.530
It is fundamentally impossible to resist fate.

00:00:47.890 --> 00:00:49.830
I believe that.

00:00:50.690 --> 00:00:54.110
Shibata-sensei was able to escape from the fate of becoming Jigoku Shoujo.

00:00:54.870 --> 00:00:56.430
Then even I can…

00:00:57.110 --> 00:01:00.540
I won't become Jigoku Shoujo!

00:01:00.540 --> 00:01:01.920
Absolutely!

00:01:10.320 --> 00:01:10.990
You!

00:01:12.060 --> 00:01:13.380
What happened?

00:01:15.190 --> 00:01:17.380
Help… me…

00:01:17.570 --> 00:01:19.220
Stay with me!

00:01:19.220 --> 00:01:21.160
Hey, you!

00:02:57.390 --> 00:03:02.380
This program is made possible by Sony Music, Aniplex,

00:03:03.330 --> 00:03:06.910
and the listed sponsors.

00:03:18.620 --> 00:03:21.260
I'm relieved you've come around!

00:03:22.540 --> 00:03:23.630
I…

00:03:23.990 --> 00:03:25.950
You collapsed in the park.

00:03:25.950 --> 00:03:28.190
I turned up at just that moment.

00:03:30.300 --> 00:03:32.890
You should rest a while longer.

00:03:32.890 --> 00:03:35.410
I'll make some warm tea.

00:03:37.340 --> 00:03:40.510
You're living alone, right?

00:03:40.510 --> 00:03:41.750
Aren't you lonely?

00:03:42.230 --> 00:03:47.510
Actually, I'm fine since I talk to my parents almost daily.

00:03:47.510 --> 00:03:49.380
Hey, how about you, Kaito-kun?

00:03:49.680 --> 00:03:51.650
What does your father do?

00:03:52.350 --> 00:03:54.230
He's a schoolteacher.

00:03:55.170 --> 00:03:58.590
My mom's a regular housewife.

00:03:59.550 --> 00:04:00.340
Oh!

00:04:01.810 --> 00:04:03.900
I need to go home now.

00:04:03.900 --> 00:04:05.150
H-Hey!

00:04:05.150 --> 00:04:07.860
Do you want to exchange cellphone numbers?

00:04:08.220 --> 00:04:09.860
What? Cellphone?

00:04:10.380 --> 00:04:12.750
To be honest, that was a lie just now.

00:04:12.750 --> 00:04:17.590
At night, I'm lonely, so I wanted someone to talk to.

00:04:19.400 --> 00:04:20.390
Sure!

00:04:21.000 --> 00:04:22.120
Thanks!

00:04:23.780 --> 00:04:25.090
Bye bye!

00:04:35.340 --> 00:04:36.910
What should I do?

00:04:36.910 --> 00:04:38.380
That's a lot of sweat!

00:04:40.880 --> 00:04:43.040
What is… this?

00:04:44.770 --> 00:04:48.700
Those wounds… someone must have hurt him!

00:04:48.700 --> 00:04:51.730
Such a small child accessing the Hell Correspondence?

00:04:51.730 --> 00:04:54.390
No, I must stop him!

00:05:08.300 --> 00:05:11.910
I heard Kaito came home late today.

00:05:12.630 --> 00:05:15.620
That's bad, not even contacting Mom.

00:05:15.990 --> 00:05:18.290
Oh, about that, I…

00:05:18.290 --> 00:05:20.490
Lying about being sick…

00:05:20.490 --> 00:05:22.810
What a troublesome big brother!

00:05:22.810 --> 00:05:25.150
No, I didn't lie…

00:05:25.150 --> 00:05:28.540
Even though all he has to do is say he wants to play.

00:05:28.540 --> 00:05:32.650
Ma-tan, don't become a liar like your big brother!

00:05:34.100 --> 00:05:36.650
But I, really…

00:05:36.990 --> 00:05:40.340
Kaito, Mom's baby is due soon.

00:05:40.340 --> 00:05:42.550
You should be with her, right?

00:05:43.010 --> 00:05:44.140
You're right.

00:05:46.850 --> 00:05:48.040
Sorry.

00:05:50.620 --> 00:05:56.890
One day, from the prince of the castle came an invitation for a ball.

00:05:57.420 --> 00:06:03.290
However, the poor Cinderella didn't have a dress to wear.

00:06:04.040 --> 00:06:08.930
This is Mom's first birth, and she feels uneasy.

00:06:09.270 --> 00:06:11.020
You can forgive her, right?

00:06:11.020 --> 00:06:12.370
Yeah.

00:06:12.370 --> 00:06:13.610
I know.

00:06:14.140 --> 00:06:17.960
Once Mao is born, everything will go back to normal.

00:06:18.790 --> 00:06:22.480
Then we can go to that forest again, right?

00:06:23.050 --> 00:06:25.980
Oh, let's go together, the four of us.

00:06:28.120 --> 00:06:30.160
Go ahead, I'll finish this up.

00:06:30.490 --> 00:06:31.610
Thanks.

00:06:36.730 --> 00:06:38.220
Hello?

00:06:38.220 --> 00:06:39.380
Kaito-kun?

00:06:39.660 --> 00:06:41.430
Oh, Onee-chan!

00:06:41.430 --> 00:06:43.270
Can you talk on the phone right now?

00:06:42.400 --> 00:06:46.130
Then, a magician appeared and said,

00:06:43.430 --> 00:06:44.380
Yeah.

00:06:46.490 --> 00:06:52.850
"Cinderella, you're a child with a kind heart."

00:06:49.610 --> 00:06:50.910
I'm fine.

00:06:51.850 --> 00:06:52.870
You're right.

00:06:52.890 --> 00:06:58.770
"As a reward, I'll use my magic to let you go to the ball."

00:06:54.160 --> 00:06:56.550
I did! Up to level 4!

00:06:56.790 --> 00:06:59.910
Oh, there, at the special place…

00:07:06.460 --> 00:07:07.780
Kaito-kun!

00:07:08.010 --> 00:07:09.170
Onee-chan!

00:07:09.860 --> 00:07:11.220
Were you surprised?

00:07:11.220 --> 00:07:14.790
Since you haven't replied to my mails recently, I came to meet you.

00:07:14.960 --> 00:07:20.310
Oh, sorry, I broke my cellphone, so…

00:07:21.270 --> 00:07:22.800
Did you drop it?

00:07:22.910 --> 00:07:24.370
Uh… uh, yeah.

00:07:24.370 --> 00:07:25.610
Aren't I stupid?

00:07:27.860 --> 00:07:30.020
Hey, want to come over to my house now?

00:07:30.020 --> 00:07:32.800
I bought that game you said you wanted to play since then.

00:07:33.180 --> 00:07:34.690
What? Really?

00:07:34.840 --> 00:07:37.940
Oh, sorry, today's a bit…

00:07:37.940 --> 00:07:40.510
You have something to do?

00:07:40.510 --> 00:07:43.350
Something… more like…

00:07:44.900 --> 00:07:47.690
Oh, a little sister soon?

00:07:49.150 --> 00:07:50.590
She's called Mao.

00:07:50.590 --> 00:07:54.620
Mom's really excited about Mao's birth.

00:07:54.620 --> 00:07:57.700
So, I wanted to help.

00:07:57.700 --> 00:07:59.160
So you're helping out?

00:07:59.160 --> 00:08:00.350
How admirable!

00:08:00.350 --> 00:08:01.080
No…

00:08:02.650 --> 00:08:04.080
Not really.

00:08:06.590 --> 00:08:08.590
What is this? They're broken!

00:08:10.100 --> 00:08:12.170
What? Oh…

00:08:12.970 --> 00:08:15.210
Sorry, I'll immediately go…

00:08:14.630 --> 00:08:19.540
Again, I wonder why your big brother's like this?

00:08:19.730 --> 00:08:23.430
Maybe he's doing it on purpose!

00:08:22.720 --> 00:08:23.840
No, really…!

00:08:24.010 --> 00:08:28.450
For such a treacherous child, punishment is needed!

00:08:46.260 --> 00:08:48.180
She's called Ootsu Nanami.

00:08:48.510 --> 00:08:52.600
An old student of mine, in truth, she's…

00:08:53.270 --> 00:08:56.930
Nice to meet you, Kaito-kun!

00:09:02.120 --> 00:09:05.450
So I've got a present for you.

00:09:05.450 --> 00:09:07.440
It'd be nice if you liked it, but…

00:09:07.610 --> 00:09:08.670
What?

00:09:13.600 --> 00:09:14.610
Sure.

00:09:15.810 --> 00:09:18.050
Hey! It's Eggman!

00:09:18.050 --> 00:09:21.780
When I asked other kids, they said that was popular, so…

00:09:21.780 --> 00:09:24.910
Nanami-san said she searched all over for it.

00:09:24.950 --> 00:09:25.640
What?

00:09:25.640 --> 00:09:27.900
How nice, Kaito!

00:09:27.900 --> 00:09:30.400
T-Thanks.

00:09:32.610 --> 00:09:38.130
Kaito-kun, I think I'll not become your mother too soon.

00:09:39.420 --> 00:09:44.680
By taking time patiently, first of all, I'd like to become a friend you can tell anything to.

00:09:46.030 --> 00:09:47.180
What do you think?

00:09:48.340 --> 00:09:50.120
Sure.

00:09:50.450 --> 00:09:54.280
In other words, is it one of those frequent instances of mother-child bullying?

00:09:54.280 --> 00:09:57.150
Really! How selfish of her!

00:09:57.150 --> 00:09:59.690
Just because a child was conceived in her body

00:09:59.690 --> 00:10:02.700
she's being cruel to the child that has no blood connection.

00:10:03.390 --> 00:10:05.510
In any case, it's quite strange.

00:10:05.510 --> 00:10:06.730
Huh?

00:10:06.990 --> 00:10:12.070
Why doesn't that guy rat on her to his father?

00:10:12.070 --> 00:10:13.880
Now that you say that…

00:10:13.880 --> 00:10:15.730
it's indeed, quite strange.

00:10:19.270 --> 00:10:20.630
What should I do?

00:10:20.630 --> 00:10:23.450
At this rate, Kaito-kun will access the Hell Correspondence!

00:10:23.450 --> 00:10:25.030
Why not discuss this with someone?

00:10:26.120 --> 00:10:27.520
To your parents.

00:10:27.520 --> 00:10:29.060
Aren't you close to them?

00:10:32.020 --> 00:10:32.900
Oh, right.

00:10:42.830 --> 00:10:45.520
Kikuri's the next Jigoku Shoujo, after all!

00:10:45.520 --> 00:10:46.790
Absolutely!

00:10:46.950 --> 00:10:47.790
Impossible.

00:10:47.790 --> 00:10:49.250
Absolutely!

00:10:49.250 --> 00:10:49.870
Impossible.

00:10:49.870 --> 00:10:50.990
Absolutely!

00:10:50.990 --> 00:10:51.970
Stop pestering me.

00:10:57.670 --> 00:11:00.500
Ai, you idiot!

00:11:02.470 --> 00:11:04.510
What? Not home?

00:11:04.820 --> 00:11:06.270
Really…

00:11:06.270 --> 00:11:10.390
I wonder if they're out for dinner or something?

00:11:13.110 --> 00:11:14.150
You threw it away?

00:11:14.510 --> 00:11:16.350
Yes, indeed.

00:11:16.350 --> 00:11:19.150
You've already used it for three years so isn't it at its life's end?

00:11:19.470 --> 00:11:21.480
But that hat's…

00:11:22.010 --> 00:11:24.940
I'll buy you a new one eventually.

00:11:24.940 --> 00:11:28.560
Mom, I wonder if it's okay to throw it away without asking.

00:11:28.560 --> 00:11:31.010
First and foremost, to you that hat is also-

00:11:30.490 --> 00:11:33.260
I was laughed at by another wife in our neightborhood

00:11:33.620 --> 00:11:36.660
because it's shabby looking.

00:11:36.660 --> 00:11:39.880
"Your little boy always wears the same hat, doesn't he?"

00:11:40.060 --> 00:11:41.980
But really…

00:11:43.290 --> 00:11:44.770
Kaito! Wait!

00:11:44.770 --> 00:11:45.740
Dear!

00:11:46.090 --> 00:11:49.340
Dear, it's because you spoil him like that.

00:11:49.340 --> 00:11:53.370
Mao's going to be born soon, so be strict on Kaito.

00:11:54.920 --> 00:11:56.110
You're right.

00:11:56.410 --> 00:11:59.160
Sorry, it's exactly as you say.

00:12:00.800 --> 00:12:01.730
It's not here.

00:12:03.210 --> 00:12:04.530
It's not here!

00:12:05.950 --> 00:12:06.750
Found it!

00:12:08.430 --> 00:12:09.630
I'm relieved.

00:12:09.720 --> 00:12:10.900
I'm relieved.

00:12:22.880 --> 00:12:23.760
I'm here.

00:12:32.760 --> 00:12:35.090
Jigoku… Shoujo?

00:12:35.310 --> 00:12:36.450
Yama-waro.

00:12:36.450 --> 00:12:38.540
Yes, Ojou.

00:12:41.530 --> 00:12:42.800
Take this.

00:12:50.770 --> 00:12:52.350
Kaito-kun.

00:13:06.020 --> 00:13:06.900
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:13:08.690 --> 00:13:10.200
What did you mean, business?

00:13:12.630 --> 00:13:13.870
Onee-chan…

00:13:15.540 --> 00:13:18.750
You accessed the Hell Correspondence, didn't you?

00:13:19.870 --> 00:13:20.950
What?

00:13:20.950 --> 00:13:24.390
The one you're trying to send to Hell, is it your mother?

00:13:24.390 --> 00:13:25.900
W-What are you talking about?

00:13:25.900 --> 00:13:27.610
I don't kno-

00:13:26.610 --> 00:13:27.530
Don't hide it from me!

00:13:29.560 --> 00:13:30.980
I can hear them.

00:13:31.330 --> 00:13:34.540
I can hear your heart's shrieks, Kaito-kun.

00:13:36.770 --> 00:13:39.190
I just want to help you, Kaito-kun.

00:13:39.190 --> 00:13:42.340
So please, say the truth!

00:13:45.760 --> 00:13:48.970
Back then, we were happy.

00:13:54.500 --> 00:13:56.600
Be careful, Kaito!

00:13:56.600 --> 00:13:58.100
Kaito-kun!

00:13:58.100 --> 00:14:00.830
I'll buy you one again, so come over here!

00:14:00.830 --> 00:14:02.560
My Eggman is…!

00:14:02.880 --> 00:14:05.380
That lake's deep!

00:14:05.380 --> 00:14:07.940
If you fall, you can't come back!

00:14:07.940 --> 00:14:09.210
Kaito!

00:14:09.210 --> 00:14:11.110
Hey, are you listening to me?

00:14:15.610 --> 00:14:19.050
Making us worry… if something happens to you, Kaito-kun,

00:14:19.050 --> 00:14:21.580
we wouldn't be a happy family anymore!

00:14:21.980 --> 00:14:26.300
I'm sorry. I'm sorry, Mom.

00:14:33.420 --> 00:14:36.060
I want to return to those days!

00:14:37.940 --> 00:14:39.240
You can return.

00:14:39.240 --> 00:14:41.260
I'll figure something out.

00:14:41.260 --> 00:14:44.070
So you can't rely on the Hell Correspondence!

00:14:44.470 --> 00:14:45.530
Got it?

00:14:46.070 --> 00:14:47.050
Sure.

00:14:49.860 --> 00:14:51.620
My wife's committing Domestic Violence?

00:14:52.850 --> 00:14:55.650
So that's what you meant by something important.

00:14:55.650 --> 00:14:56.850
It's the truth!

00:14:56.850 --> 00:15:00.690
I saw them. There are numerous scars on Kaito-kun's body!

00:15:01.310 --> 00:15:04.670
Um, you might not know,

00:15:04.670 --> 00:15:08.170
but boys that age often get scratches.

00:15:08.330 --> 00:15:10.360
That's not what I'm talking about!

00:15:10.360 --> 00:15:13.180
Getting hit, pinched…

00:15:13.680 --> 00:15:18.690
Well then, let me ask you this: did Kaito say that they were done by his mother?

00:15:19.790 --> 00:15:21.110
Well…

00:15:21.110 --> 00:15:22.870
But I can tell!

00:15:22.870 --> 00:15:24.400
Kaito-kun's heart's shrieks!

00:15:25.610 --> 00:15:26.670
Stop fooling around.

00:15:28.130 --> 00:15:30.610
We're a respectable household.

00:15:30.610 --> 00:15:33.470
If you're going to make strange accusations, I've got a few ideas as well.

00:15:39.050 --> 00:15:40.770
How stupid of you;

00:15:40.770 --> 00:15:43.210
that man noticed a while ago.

00:15:46.670 --> 00:15:49.260
He's pretending not to notice it,

00:15:49.260 --> 00:15:51.020
his own pitiful self.

00:15:51.990 --> 00:15:53.520
That can't be…

00:15:55.480 --> 00:15:57.110
Is it not enough,

00:15:57.870 --> 00:15:59.520
Just as I feared.

00:16:13.750 --> 00:16:16.660
I'm sorry, Mom!

00:16:21.410 --> 00:16:23.030
Sorry,

00:16:23.030 --> 00:16:24.240
Kaito.

00:16:28.830 --> 00:16:32.220
Answer the phone! Mother, answer the phone!

00:16:32.660 --> 00:16:35.670
Even though I want to discuss this with you, why?

00:16:35.670 --> 00:16:36.730
Answer the phone!

00:16:37.740 --> 00:16:39.030
Answer the phone!

00:16:42.390 --> 00:16:43.710
You've got the Maternity Record Book, right?

00:16:43.920 --> 00:16:46.190
Yes, I'm leaving now.

00:16:46.770 --> 00:16:48.580
Good luck, Mom.

00:16:53.750 --> 00:16:56.630
I wonder if she's okay not going by car.

00:16:56.630 --> 00:16:58.590
Mom said it was fine.

00:16:58.590 --> 00:16:59.530
She should be okay.

00:17:00.330 --> 00:17:01.930
More importantly, Kaito,

00:17:01.930 --> 00:17:03.550
want to go to the forest?

00:17:03.550 --> 00:17:04.460
What?

00:17:04.840 --> 00:17:07.470
Weren't you saying you wanted to go for a while?

00:17:07.470 --> 00:17:10.460
Once in a while, just the two of us, eh?

00:17:13.260 --> 00:17:17.830
I thought it over last night, but ultimately, I couldn't come up with anything good.

00:17:17.830 --> 00:17:19.350
What should I do?

00:17:19.350 --> 00:17:21.620
At this rate, Kaito-kun will…

00:17:24.200 --> 00:17:26.330
Kaito-kun, wait!

00:17:40.940 --> 00:17:43.460
Come out, Jigoku Shoujo!

00:17:50.090 --> 00:17:52.700
Come out! You're here, aren't you?!

00:17:52.700 --> 00:17:54.010
I'm right here.

00:17:55.130 --> 00:17:58.120
Let me see Kaito-kun. Please!

00:17:58.120 --> 00:18:00.490
What do you plan to do after meeting him?

00:18:00.490 --> 00:18:02.280
That's obvious! I'm going to stop him!

00:18:03.720 --> 00:18:06.730
You cannot stop him.

00:18:07.340 --> 00:18:10.470
That's not true! If I see him and talk to him, he'll surely…

00:18:11.800 --> 00:18:14.740
Real Hell is inside a person.

00:18:15.680 --> 00:18:17.490
Inside of you, too.

00:18:18.220 --> 00:18:20.240
It would be good for you to see it with your own eyes.

00:18:34.160 --> 00:18:35.280
Where am I?

00:18:35.280 --> 00:18:36.290
Hey, here we go!

00:18:36.290 --> 00:18:36.910
Yeah!

00:18:36.530 --> 00:18:37.650
Kaito-kun?

00:18:37.750 --> 00:18:40.020
Kaito-kun! Kaito-kun!

00:18:40.490 --> 00:18:41.780
Kaito-kun!

00:18:42.730 --> 00:18:43.830
Nice catch!

00:18:49.640 --> 00:18:52.740
Well then, this time I'll apply spin!

00:19:02.330 --> 00:19:03.330
There!

00:19:07.870 --> 00:19:09.380
Oh, my bad.

00:19:09.570 --> 00:19:11.830
I'm tired out already.

00:19:11.830 --> 00:19:14.250
It's okay, I'll go get it!

00:19:18.650 --> 00:19:21.970
Kaito, do you like your mother?

00:19:22.230 --> 00:19:23.780
Sure I do.

00:19:23.780 --> 00:19:26.470
She's pretty, good at cooking…

00:19:27.160 --> 00:19:28.760
Right.

00:19:28.760 --> 00:19:30.500
I also like your mother.

00:19:31.450 --> 00:19:35.260
She's pure, cheerful, and was popular amongst the male students.

00:19:35.840 --> 00:19:38.190
Your mother like that chose me, your father.

00:19:38.640 --> 00:19:39.930
I was glad.

00:19:43.010 --> 00:19:47.790
I don't want to see your mother falling apart anymore.

00:19:48.270 --> 00:19:49.170
You're in danger!

00:19:49.330 --> 00:19:51.390
Kaito-kun! Run away!

00:19:51.390 --> 00:19:52.640
Run away!

00:19:52.750 --> 00:19:55.720
Kaito, I've been thinking…

00:19:55.720 --> 00:20:00.010
Making your mother bring up two kids might be impossible.

00:20:01.190 --> 00:20:04.340
I think so, too.

00:20:04.340 --> 00:20:06.150
That's why…

00:20:06.150 --> 00:20:07.710
There's no other way.

00:20:16.660 --> 00:20:19.270
Your grudge has been received.

00:20:30.140 --> 00:20:31.200
Dad…

00:20:33.240 --> 00:20:34.280
I…

00:20:35.030 --> 00:20:37.060
What have I done?!

00:20:39.120 --> 00:20:41.170
Don't cry, Dad.

00:20:41.170 --> 00:20:43.120
It's fine, now.

00:20:43.630 --> 00:20:45.930
Right, Dad?

00:20:45.930 --> 00:20:47.140
Let's go home.

00:21:05.460 --> 00:21:08.420
What a shame, what happened to Mao…

00:21:10.740 --> 00:21:13.910
But Dad and I are here.

00:21:16.000 --> 00:21:17.920
It's like before.

00:21:22.670 --> 00:21:25.430
Your hands are warm, Mom.

00:21:37.820 --> 00:21:40.290
Be careful, Kaito!

00:21:40.310 --> 00:21:41.310
Kaito!

00:21:41.820 --> 00:21:44.580
I'll buy you one again, so come over here!

00:21:44.580 --> 00:21:46.300
My Eggman is…!

00:21:46.750 --> 00:21:48.890
That lake's deep!

00:21:48.890 --> 00:21:51.290
If you fall, you can't come back!

00:21:57.420 --> 00:21:58.020
I got it!

00:21:58.020 --> 00:22:00.050
Quite a family.

00:22:00.050 --> 00:22:04.850
They're laughing as if nothing happened after seeing Hell.

00:22:06.120 --> 00:22:07.820
I wonder if it's going to come,

00:22:07.820 --> 00:22:12.020
the day they realize what sins they've committed.

00:22:11.110 --> 00:22:12.020
Yes, Hime.

00:22:15.440 --> 00:22:16.540
Snow?

00:22:16.890 --> 00:22:18.440
Snow, eh?

00:22:18.440 --> 00:22:20.250
It'll come, probably.

00:22:20.250 --> 00:22:26.300
But for now, this snow will probably cover up all that sin.

00:22:26.300 --> 00:22:27.550
You're right.

00:22:27.940 --> 00:22:29.440
Kaito, do you want to fish, too?

00:22:29.440 --> 00:22:31.120
Really, Dad?

00:22:31.120 --> 00:22:32.270
Sure, go ahead.

00:22:44.300 --> 00:22:49.800
Note: Candle says Kikuchi Kaito.

00:22:44.510 --> 00:22:49.800
Your grudge shall be released.

00:24:20.280 --> 00:24:21.770
Your name?

00:24:21.980 --> 00:24:24.290
Isono Sumika.

00:24:24.290 --> 00:24:25.790
You hate her?

00:24:26.090 --> 00:24:28.420
I don't really hate her.

00:24:28.420 --> 00:24:30.660
That girl is beautiful and sparkling.

00:24:31.270 --> 00:24:33.920
So I'm fine with being a shadow.

00:24:34.560 --> 00:24:36.540
I've always thought that way.

00:24:36.540 --> 00:24:38.190
I thought that was fine.

00:24:38.690 --> 00:24:42.250
But then I realized…

00:24:43.050 --> 00:24:45.790
That was your fate since birth.

00:24:45.910 --> 00:24:48.820
Next time: Flower and Moon.

00:24:50.710 --> 00:24:55.880
